{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Fight giant bugs with your mech!</strong> Liberate the alien planet for your cause. In this top-down twin stick shooter, fight bugs as you secure the planet for humankind.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/HiveStampersGameplay4.gif?t=1748834399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Five weapons</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Whether you need a strong sniper rifle or a crowd-controlling grenade launcher, these weapons will help you get the job done.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/WeaponsGifFix.gif?t=1748834399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Numerous bug types</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Varying from hard-headed turtle ants to stag beetles, wolf spiders to tiny swarm bees, squash all the bugs you can find!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/HiveStampersGameplay6.gif?t=1748834399\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>4 areas</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From massive beehive to spiders nest, these bug-infested levels need to be cleared out!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/extras/HiveStampersPreviewV3__1_.gif?t=1748834399\" /></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646610?t=1748834399","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3646610?t=1748834399","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3646610/86958500044fc46c7c23d87313690f027b84bff7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1748834399","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s